This product adapts UI patterns from Marginalia
(https://github.com/borgand/marginalia), Copyright (c) 2026 Laas Toom,
licensed under the MIT License.

The adapted work is presentation and interaction design only:

  - the rounded status pill
  - the connection chip with its footer status line and activity log
  - the card queue with a status colour down each card's left edge, its
    collapsible status headers, and the progress ribbon above it
  - capturing a note in a balloon anchored at the caret, and the button that
    floats over a selection
  - marking pinned code in the editor: the line tint, the error-stripe mark,
    the gutter pin, and the tinted editor tab
  - anchoring a pin to a RangeMarker so it follows its code, including the
    rule that a snippet matching in several places is refused rather than
    guessed at

Everything was rewritten against this project's own model and platform usage.
No Marginalia source file is redistributed here.
